    "text": "The \ufb01rst model uses an agent-based simulation that assumes each boat acts in its own best interest. This allows boaters to travel without having to follow a prede\ufb01ned itinerary of stops, but opens the possibility that a small fraction (less than 1%) of boaters may have to travel past nightfall to \ufb01nd an open campsite. We \ufb01nd in this model that it is bene\ufb01cial to require boats to start each day as early as possible and to require the slower row boats to take longer trips (between 12 and 18 nights)."
  },
